    <title>30 和过去的自己握手言和这件事，终于在28岁这一年发生了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a092737236c546e42496a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669a092737236c546e42496a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近是在和过去的自己进行一些和解的小桑，我好像越来越愿意去和那段曾经总是不愿意提及的时光面对面了，站在过去的自己面前的时候，会用成年人的眼光去重新对待她，去告诉她你很不错很独特。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候会觉得同学和老师的目光就是全世界，那时候浸润在狭窄的空间里难以真正看到世界的全貌，终于在现在的年纪里，我才能认知到当时的自己其实早就已经开始走向完整。</span></p><span></span><p><span>和过去的自己握手言和这件事，终于在28岁这一年发生了。太好了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏州姑娘 / 旅居在世界各地</span></p><span></span><p><span>品牌/旅游行业从业者 / 2019福布斯U30</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在是无业游民 / 持续解锁人生新体验中</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750"><span>sunnny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787"><span>sunny睡醒啦</span></a><span> ｜ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808"><span>sunny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：第八颗星球</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:drizzzl@163.com"><span>drizzzl@163.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
