    <guid isPermaLink="false">660cfda9c891c06e7311a325</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝了酒睡不着的夜晚，聊了聊最近读过的书，看过的电影，幸福的小事和情绪，以及对于下一次旅居生活的期待和准备。像这样没有主题的闲聊对我来说就像重新回到一个声音日记本的感受，在阐述我最近的生活，但也在记录当下的情绪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天真的很能让人觉得幸福，春日夜晚大片嫩绿色的树丛，雨后潮湿但清爽的空气，人与人的相遇与重逢。和这个季节一样，萌生了许多充满生命力的想法与期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家也能在春夜里追着月亮，期待新的日子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏州姑娘 / 旅居在世界各地</span></p><span></span><p><span>品牌/旅游行业从业者 / 2019福布斯U30</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在是无业游民 / 持续解锁人生新体验中</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750"><span>sunnny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787"><span>sunny睡醒啦</span></a><span> ｜ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808"><span>sunny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：第八颗星球</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:drizzzl@163.com"><span>drizzzl@163.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
