  <item>
    <title>26 回到老家才发现，我们都活在彼此真空的世界里</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ccba1eb6c9256aeed75755</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ccba1eb6c9256aeed75755</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Feb 2024 13:03:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>回到苏州过年的这几天里，经历了许多无效社交。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管是亲戚还是许多年未见过的朋友，都对那些我不关心的事情提出了追问与质疑，这样的质疑打破了我对浪漫生活的幻象，也压得我喘不过气来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接受现实一定指的就是那个安稳的、平静的现实吗？不能是悬浮的、浪漫的、不确定的现实吗？我在我自己创造出的乌托邦里自得其乐，而老家的人们也在固有的规则里找到了确定的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都活在彼此真空的世界里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏州姑娘 / base上海 / 游荡在世界各地</span></p><span></span><p><span>品牌/旅游行业从业者 / 2019福布斯U30</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在是无业游民 / 持续解锁人生新体验中</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750"><span>sunnny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787"><span>sunny睡醒啦</span></a><span> ｜ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6ab0087580000016c6a02?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507808"><span>sunny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：第八颗星球</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:drizzzl@163.com"><span>drizzzl@163.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
