    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目邀请了我一起在西藏旅居的朋友，来聊聊我们旅居上半个月的精彩生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为她在此次旅居之前已经去过了两个城市度过了两个月的旅居生活，所以也借着聊天提问了一些我对她好奇的问题，包括「旅居的花销大吗？」「旅居和旅行的区别？」以及「旅居真的和大家想象里一样美好吗？」</span></p><span></span><p><span>更重要的是，在这短短的半个月人生新体验中，我确切地感受到了我正在逐渐消失的社会时钟和物欲。我们的精神达到了充分饱和的状态，每一天都是幸福的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家围观我的图片版西藏旅居日记：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507387" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507387"><span>点击🔗观看</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/dUXUsA" data-url="http://xhslink.com/dUXUsA"><span>▶️ 惊喜的日落金山</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/6cbVsA" data-url="http://xhslink.com/6cbVsA"><span>▶️ 来时飞机上望去的雪山</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/rpjVsA" data-url="http://xhslink.com/rpjVsA"><span>▶️ 在拉萨河度过的惬意傍晚</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/l5rVsA" data-url="http://xhslink.com/l5rVsA"><span>▶️ 大理古城摆摊盛况</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏州姑娘 / base上海 / 游荡在世界各地</span></p><span></span><p><span>品牌/旅游行业从业者 / 2019福布斯U30</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在是无业游民 / 持续解锁人生新体验中</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2922402750"><span>sunnny睡不醒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/632424a0000000002303846f?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=632424a0000000002303846f&amp;apptime=1706507787"><span>sunny睡醒啦</span></a><span> ｜ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd6a